{"game": "mass-effect-3", "language": "english", "appid": 1238020, "month": "2024-07", "window": 1, "start_date": 1719792000, "end_date": 1722470399, "month_true_total": 17, "quota": 17, "returned": 17, "pulled_at": "2026-10-07 19:54:42 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "171133411", "author": {"steamid": "76561198163844633", "personaname": "NewMystery356", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/NewMystery356/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 10, "playtime_forever": 2659, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2623, "last_played": 1722473622, "avatar": "d0cbba790f0ac2f79d4c861cf05f3c556fb8cbfd"}, "language": "english", "review": "Apart from the stunning \"space opera\" that went across 3 games (and an entire adolesence), the multiplayer is still really fun. Once you have the Classes you enjoy playing as, it feels like less of a slog and you can really start to enjoy it.", "timestamp_created": 1722389683, "timestamp_updated": 1722389683, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887286", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "171088958", "author": {"steamid": "76561198158219766", "personaname": "Chrismas199", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198158219766/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 6, "playtime_forever": 26033, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 5826, "last_played": 1789418058, "avatar": "7eda5a49e17347cc1c619bc60bd0750a76051d17"}, "language": "english", "review": "Fix your game EA. 96 hours of playtime and you want the CD key again. Are you insane EA?", "timestamp_created": 1722339088, "timestamp_updated": 1722339088, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 17, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.673551321029663086", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887286", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 16, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "171029647", "author": {"steamid": "76561199053007114", "personaname": "KartoffelsackTV", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/KartoffelsackTV/", "num_games_owned": 360, "num_reviews": 25, "playtime_forever": 2588, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1831, "last_played": 1722542779, "avatar": "0c7eff4e27c2d0ee6e9d01aee0852daa8ee2e1ed"}, "language": "english", "review": "good game", "timestamp_created": 1722261183, "timestamp_updated": 1722261183, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887286", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "170869639", "author": {"steamid": "76561198311948433", "personaname": "Spinjitzu Master", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Spinjitzu_Master/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 19, "playtime_forever": 4956, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 4467, "last_played": 1772966101, "avatar": "3604ac34b47c87e187d151f22aa17e107253ce34"}, "language": "english", "review": "Amazing Multiplayer even to this day, absolute must try for Mass Effect enjoyers.", "timestamp_created": 1722072926, "timestamp_updated": 1772807590, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887286", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "170800756", "author": {"steamid": "76561197975685495", "personaname": "Nicholas", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/ShadowFFVI/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 296, "playtime_forever": 2489, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2375, "last_played": 1735100236, "avatar": "4b46b10577cb132d09a4385b64f1b75238b59f60"}, "language": "english", "review": "Despite the somewhat disappointing ending I still think this is a great game. In my opinion the first few hours feature some of the best Mass Effect gameplay sequences in the entire series. And the multiplayer - while not featuring a ton of depth was still a really nice welcome and fun addition for me that helped extend the longevity of the game and was something fun to team up with friends on.\r\n\r\nThe DLC does also help remedy some of the sting of the original ending, as the last one I especially feel gives the characters the send off they deserve.", "timestamp_created": 1721999833, "timestamp_updated": 1721999833, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887286", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "170608035", "author": {"steamid": "76561197989921292", "personaname": "Pillagebones", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/pillagebones/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 1905, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1798, "last_played": 1723912307, "avatar": "d0a8f8e69079cec2324a97b793fbd137bc65e8a0"}, "language": "english", "review": "I own the Legendary Edition and have been doing an Insanity playthrough of all 3 games, but I found out through Steam reviews that the servers are still up and ****this is worth the buy for the functional multiplayer alone****. Like anything it can start to feel a bit grind-y if you play nothing else but I think it's super unique and fun and I find myself coming back pretty often, even now. I'm about 30 hours in at this point and still have a large handful of characters, weapons, mods and equipment to unlock.\n\nI'm Command Shepard, and this is my favorite shop on the Citadel.", "timestamp_created": 1721802609, "timestamp_updated": 1721802696, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 4, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.568254053592681885", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887286", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "170583219", "author": {"steamid": "76561198025753635", "personaname": "Quixotte", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198025753635/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 468, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 468, "last_played": 1721769176, "avatar": "e6ed994c832023be11db27412b48e84bd13b7e30"}, "language": "english", "review": "The EA app is needed for this game. The game might be good, but the EA app simply does not work properly and I cannot play it anymore.", "timestamp_created": 1721769509, "timestamp_updated": 1721769509, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 13, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.648289620876312256", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887286", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "169944713", "author": {"steamid": "76561198169133553", "personaname": "Raz'Hikel", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198169133553/", "num_games_owned": 513, "num_reviews": 89, "playtime_forever": 1134, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1054, "last_played": 1725306647, "avatar": "8b278d6b577d823147f48a666be433be588a9041"}, "language": "english", "review": "Went in with low expectations, since people consider this the weakest mass effect, and came out pretty surprised.\n\nEasily the best combat out of the trilogy, weapons are no longer restricted to certain classes, movement is much snappier and faster and commanding your squadmates is even more fluid.\n\nIt does fall short in the story department however, although topping ME2's finale was already a hard call. A lot of cutscenes don't represent your decisions very well; for example if you failed to secure support from the krogan or the asari they'll still show up in the final battle on earth.\n\nAdditionally, the ending REALLY could have used a proper epilogue;\nit's not bad on its own merit but given that this is the conclusion to a trilogy, there should have been a post-finale scene showing what happened to the various characters, planets and species you encountered after the reaper war ends. Like the fallout epilogues.\n\nSquadmates are okay, not as good as ME2 and most of them are returning characters from the first game if you kept them alive. (Not a bad thing necessarily) and the 3 new ones are all solid.\nAlthough I would have liked to see some of the squadmates from the second game return, going from the huge roster of characters to choose from to only having a handful is pretty lame, especially with the huge ship you have.\n\nTL;DR: Strongest gameplay in the trilogy, weakest story and an unsatisfying ending.", "timestamp_created": 1721068211, "timestamp_updated": 1721068248, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 3, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.551107645034790039", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887286", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "169719907", "author": {"steamid": "76561198034850759", "personaname": "Ijrs", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Ijrs/", "num_games_owned": 135, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 22, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 22, "last_played": 1720823034, "avatar": "d04dd2b3f6958cb3a414a2c2f8654d32d244e556"}, "language": "english", "review": "Cant run the game because of the stupid EA launcher.", "timestamp_created": 1720823093, "timestamp_updated": 1720823093, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 6, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.557414710521697998", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887286", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "169480828", "author": {"steamid": "76561198037157930", "personaname": "The_Last_Cow", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198037157930/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 144, "playtime_forever": 2003, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 283, "last_played": 1724117228, "avatar": "4c7dd614de3a5335267bf605600f7b9cc7be4a07"}, "language": "english", "review": "I'm not sure why the vibes felt better in ME2 maybe it's the music but this game is alright. The EA app is super annoying and the game randomly minimizes itself every hour-ish? Very strange behavior.\n\nEdit: Every week I try to launch this game a new problem arises with origin or the ea app or whatever it's called it's really awful. Why can't I just get in the game right away like ME1 and ME2?", "timestamp_created": 1720594411, "timestamp_updated": 1722295523, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 3, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.554976165294647217", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887286", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "169409034", "author": {"steamid": "76561199252297545", "personaname": "Ra", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199252297545/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 22, "playtime_forever": 19486, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 7, "last_played": 1762548352, "avatar": "585928b9ed7bb4bcf1239c6b8749698459359155"}, "language": "english", "review": "I've played the third part of the series in the Legendary Edition. This game was simply beyond amazing...\nAnd the adventure still goes on with the Multiplayer Mode in ME3. I am having a blast :D", "timestamp_created": 1720528607, "timestamp_updated": 1720870198, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887286", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "169132371", "author": {"steamid": "76561198287570981", "personaname": "Unknown Kiwi", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198287570981/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 93, "playtime_forever": 9, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 9, "last_played": 1720260315, "avatar": "d84c21a60756feb8a22d2e505af06cf810e147ad"}, "language": "english", "review": "0/10 Cannot even launch on fresh install", "timestamp_created": 1720260362, "timestamp_updated": 1720260362, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 5, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.536433696746826172", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887286", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "169037149", "author": {"steamid": "76561199092772420", "personaname": "Melancholy in Leather Jacket